                      DUAL-PACKAGE COMPILATION & CONSUMPTION FLOW
========================================================================================

 Source Code (TSX)
       │
       ├───► [ tsup Engine ]
       │            │
       │            ├───► Output ESM:  dist/index.mjs  (import statements, pure)
